  <dialog id="meal-dialog"><div class="dialog-body">
    <div class="dialog-top"><h2 id="meal-dialog-title">Ajouter une prise alimentaire</h2><button class="close" data-close="meal-dialog" aria-label="Fermer">×</button></div>
    <p class="dialog-desc" id="meal-day">Choisis un type, puis personnalise son nom et son heure.</p>
    <div class="field"><label for="meal-preset">Type de repas</label><select id="meal-preset">
      <option value="breakfast">Petit-déjeuner</option><option value="morning">Collation du matin</option>
      <option value="afternoon" selected>Collation de l’après-midi</option><option value="evening">Collation du soir</option>
      <option value="other">Autre repas</option>
    </select></div>
    <div class="two-fields"><div class="field"><label for="meal-name">Nom du créneau</label><input id="meal-name" maxlength="70" placeholder="Ex. : Collation après sport"></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="meal-time">Heure indicative</label><input id="meal-time" type="time" required></div></div>
    <p class="dialog-desc">Tu choisiras ensuite la recette dans le catalogue. Ce créneau restera libre et modifiable.</p>
    <div class="dialog-footer"><span></span><div class="footer-right"><button class="button" data-close="meal-dialog" type="button">Annuler</button><button class="button primary" id="save-meal" type="button">Enregistrer</button></div></div>
  </div></dialog>
  <dialog id="recipe-dialog"><div class="dialog-body"><div class="dialog-top"><h2 id="recipe-dialog-title">Créer un plat</h2><button class="close" data-close="recipe-dialog" aria-label="Fermer">×</button></div><p class="dialog-desc">Les calories et le prix se calculent à partir de la composition d'une portion.</p><div class="two-fields"><div class="field"><label for="recipe-name">Nom du plat</label><input id="recipe-name" maxlength="90" placeholder="Ex. : Poulet aux légumes"></div><div class="field"><label for="recipe-category">Catégorie</label><select id="recipe-category"><option>Protéiné</option><option>Végétarien</option><option>Rapide</option><option>Collation</option></select></div></div><div class="two-fields"><div class="field"><label for="recipe-emoji">Emoji du plat</label><input id="recipe-emoji" maxlength="10" placeholder="🍲"></div><div class="field"><label for="recipe-batch">Adapté au batch cooking</label><select id="recipe-batch"><option value="true">Oui</option><option value="false">Non</option></select></div></div><div class="field"><label>Ingrédients par portion (en grammes)</label><div id="recipe-ingredient-rows"></div><button class="button small" id="add-recipe-ingredient" type="button">+ Ajouter un ingrédient</button></div><div class="editor-summary" id="recipe-summary"><span>0 kcal</span><span>0,00 € / portion</span></div><div class="dialog-footer"><div><button class="button danger small" id="delete-recipe" type="button" hidden>Supprimer le plat</button></div><div class="footer-right"><button class="button" data-close="recipe-dialog" type="button">Annuler</button><button class="button primary" id="save-recipe" type="button">Enregistrer</button></div></div></div></dialog>
  <dialog id="ingredient-dialog"><div class="dialog-body"><div class="dialog-top"><h2>Catalogue d'ingrédients</h2><button class="close" data-close="ingredient-dialog" aria-label="Fermer">×</button></div><p class="dialog-desc">Chaque ingrédient a des kcal pour 100 g et un prix au kilo modifiables. Les prix par défaut proviennent du fichier <code>data/prices.json</code> au build.</p><input id="ingredient-search" class="search" type="search" placeholder="Rechercher dans le catalogue…" aria-label="Rechercher un ingrédient"><div class="ingredient-catalog" id="ingredient-catalog"></div><div class="catalog-form"><h3 id="ingredient-form-title" style="font-size:14px;margin:0 0 11px">Nouvel ingrédient</h3><div class="catalog-fields"><div class="field"><label for="ingredient-name">Nom</label><input id="ingredient-name" maxlength="70" placeholder="Ex. : Haricots verts"></div><div class="field"><label for="ingredient-kcal">kcal / 100 g</label><input id="ingredient-kcal" type="number" min="0" max="1000" step="1"></div><div class="field"><label for="ingredient-price">Prix / kg (€)</label><input id="ingredient-price" type="number" min="0" max="1000" step=".01"></div></div><div class="field"><label for="ingredient-group">Rayon</label><select id="ingredient-group"><option>Fruits & légumes</option><option>Viandes & poissons</option><option>Féculents & céréales</option><option>Légumineuses</option><option>Frais & œufs</option><option>Épicerie</option></select></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px"><button id="reset-ingredient" type="button" class="button small">Nouveau</button><button id="save-ingredient" type="button" class="button primary">Enregistrer l'ingrédient</button></div><button id="reset-prices" class="button small ghost catalog-reset" type="button">Réinitialiser les prix personnalisés avec ceux du build</button></div></div></dialog>
